      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1291338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-07T03:42:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "/mnt is tmpfs, and so is /mnt/apk. We don\u0027t need restorecon for /mnt/apk because zipfuse can mount on tmpfs.\n\nHowever, we don\u0027t know how many extra apks we will have, so microdroid_manager creates mount points for the extra apks. I didn\u0027t want microdroid_manager to touch tmpfs, so I created a new label for /mnt/extra-apk.",
      "parentUuid": "16c6e264_4b9a837e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "741a469e4c4aae156dfe15db684d34c7c07ff1b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
