      "message": "It\u0027s similar to the property \"microdroid_manager.apk_root_hash\". If this is None, apkdmverity reads the idsig file for the root hash. If this is not None, the root hash of the idsig file is compared to this parameter.\n\nI added this because root hashes are different for different APKs (main apk vs extra apks). For the readabaility, I changed the name to \"saved_root_hash\".",
